OL,3,GNEWSACambridge vice-chancellor heckled
OL,4,Aat Arday vigil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vice-chancellor of the University
OL,7,Fof Cambridge was heckled as she was
OL,8,Fseen in public for the first time since
OL,9,Fthe death of former professor Jason
OL,10,FArday.
OL,12,FProf Deborah Prentice attended a vigil
OL,13,Forganised by the campaign group Stand
OL,14,FUp to Racism in Cambridge city centre
OL,15,Fon Monday evening.
OL,17,FShouting from a signpost in the city's
OL,18,Fmarket square, one attendee called
OL,19,FPrentice "shameful" for failing to
OL,20,Fattend another event organised by
OL,21,FArday's students on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
